# --- Store Patcher (Windows Phone app) -------------------------------------
# The app keeps its own Visual Studio .gitignore next to the solution; these are
# repeated here so build output and machine-local state can never be committed by
# accident, even if that file is ever dropped.
StorePatcher/**/Bin/
StorePatcher/**/obj/
StorePatcher/**/.vs/
StorePatcher/**/*.xap
StorePatcher/**/*.appx
StorePatcher/**/*.suo
StorePatcher/**/*.user
StorePatcher/**/*.appxrecipe
StorePatcher/**/AppPackages/
# Per-install, generated from the lab CA by `node tools/app.mjs patch`.
StorePatcher/**/patches.json
